### Get all playable games( for now stored in memory adapter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/games
Accept: application/json

### Get access token with admin user
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/banditgames/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=platform-backend&client_secret=pzT1SWzQ1qrajmjPUiBeAphsTSyofq5t&username=admin@admin&password=admin

//saving the access token
> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}
###

### List draft games
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/games/draft
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Approve a game
@gameId = dc65a181-ef57-47c0-8168-69a4c1cd1c53
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/games/{{gameId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### reject a game
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/games/0cf54383-a9fb-41de-94e3-d9915d793688/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### get pending games
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/games/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json
